<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Online Hotel Room Booking</title>

<style>
*{
margin:0;
padding:0;
box-sizing:border-box;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}

body{
background:#f4f4f4;
}

header{
background:#003366;
color:white;
padding:15px;
}

nav{
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
align-items:center;
}

nav ul{
display:flex;
list-style:none;
}

nav ul li{
margin:0 15px;
}

nav ul li a{
color:white;
text-decoration:none;
}

.hero{
background:#0d6efd;
color:white;
text-align:center;
padding:70px;
}

section{
padding:30px;
}

.card{
background:white;
padding:20px;
margin:20px 0;
border-radius:10px;
box-shadow:0 0 10px gray;
}

input,select,textarea{
width:100%;
padding:10px;
margin:10px 0;
}

button{
padding:10px 20px;
background:#0d6efd;
color:white;
border:none;
cursor:pointer;
}

table{
width:100%;
border-collapse:collapse;
margin-top:20px;
}

table,th,td{
border:1px solid black;
}

th,td{
padding:10px;
text-align:center;
}

footer{
background:#003366;
color:white;
text-align:center;
padding:20px;
margin-top:30px;
}
</style>

</head>

<body>

<header>

<nav>

<h2>Luxury Hotel</h2>

<ul>

<li><a href="#">Home</a></li>
<li><a href="#">Rooms</a></li>
<li><a href="#">Booking</a></li>
<li><a href="#">Profile</a></li>
<li><a href="#">Login</a></li>
<li><a href="#">Register</a></li>
<li><a href="#">Contact</a></li>

</ul>

</nav>

</header>

<div class="hero">

<h1>Online Hotel Room Booking System</h1>

<p>Book your room easily and securely.</p>

</div>

<section>

<div class="card">

<h2>Search Room Availability</h2>

<form>

<label>Destination</label>
<input type="text" placeholder="Enter Destination">

<label>Check-In</label>
<input type="date">

<label>Check-Out</label>
<input type="date">

<label>Guests</label>
<select>
<option>1 Guest</option>
<option>2 Guests</option>
<option>3 Guests</option>
<option>4 Guests</option>
</select>

<button>Check Availability</button>

</form>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>Room Types</h2>

<ul>

<li>Standard Room - ₹2500/Night</li>
<li>Deluxe Room - ₹4000/Night</li>
<li>Executive Room - ₹6000/Night</li>
<li>Suite Room - ₹8500/Night</li>

</ul>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>User Registration</h2>

<form>

<input type="text" placeholder="Full Name">

<input type="email" placeholder="Email">

<input type="tel" placeholder="Phone Number">

<input type="password" placeholder="Password">

<button>Register</button>

</form>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>User Login</h2>

<form>

<input type="email" placeholder="Email">

<input type="password" placeholder="Password">

<button>Login</button>

</form>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>Book a Room</h2>

<form>

<input type="text" placeholder="Full Name">

<select>

<option>Standard Room</option>
<option>Deluxe Room</option>
<option>Executive Room</option>
<option>Suite Room</option>

</select>

<input type="date">

<input type="date">

<input type="number" placeholder="Number of Guests">

<button>Book Now</button>

</form>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>Booking History</h2>

<table>

<tr>

<th>Booking ID</th>
<th>Room</th>
<th>Check-In</th>
<th>Check-Out</th>
<th>Status</th>

</tr>

<tr>

<td>101</td>
<td>Deluxe</td>
<td>20-07-2026</td>
<td>22-07-2026</td>
<td>Confirmed</td>

</tr>

</table>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>Customer Reviews</h2>

<textarea placeholder="Write your review"></textarea>

<button>Submit Review</button>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>Administrator Panel</h2>

<ul>

<li>Manage Rooms</li>
<li>Update Room Price</li>
<li>Update Room Quantity</li>
<li>Manage Bookings</li>
<li>Cancel Bookings</li>
<li>Manage Users</li>
<li>Edit About Us</li>
<li>Edit Contact Us</li>
<li>Edit FAQ</li>
<li>Edit Travel Guide</li>
<li>Edit Privacy Policy</li>

</ul>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>Customer Service Q & A</h2>

<p><b>Q:</b> Can I cancel my booking?</p>
<p><b>A:</b> Yes, up to 3 days before arrival.</p>

<p><b>Q:</b> Can I modify my booking?</p>
<p><b>A:</b> Yes, before 3 days of check-in.</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>Travel Guide</h2>

<p>Local attractions, transportation, shopping centers, and nearby tourist places are available for hotel guests.</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>Privacy Policy</h2>

<p>Your personal information is securely stored and never shared without your consent.</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>Contact Us</h2>

<p>Email: hotel@example.com</p>

<p>Phone: +91 9876543210</p>

<p>Address: Chennai, Tamil Nadu</p>

</div>

</section>

<footer>

<p>© 2026 Online Hotel Room Booking System</p>

</footer>

</body>
</html>
